      MaskType      "GridConverterControlSystem (motulator)"
      MaskDescription "Current-vector grid-following control with a PLL in the power-control mode (GridConverterControlSystem with CurrentVectorController). Each class of motulator is a block with a mask of its arguments. The top-level blocks refer to the variables of the model initialization, and the blocks inside them get their parameters as in the constructors of motulator. T_s is the sampling period of the measurements. While the input enable is not positive, the duty ratios are 0.5 and the state is reset to its initial value."
